      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "info-t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 24,
      "y": 849,
      "width": 962,
      "height": 87,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "Architecture Notes\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2022 Each project gets its own watcher (Helm-deployed per-namespace) \u2192 isolates CDC load\n\u2022 Watcher uses pgoutput plugin (no external slot consumers) \u2014 zero-config logical replication\n\u2022 NATS subject hierarchy: cdc.{projectId}.{schema}.{table}  \u2014 allows wildcard subscriptions\n\u2022 RLS is enforced in GraphQL layer before sending to client \u2014 matches query-time behavior",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "info",
      "originalText": "Architecture Notes\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2022 Each project gets its own watcher (Helm-deployed per-namespace) \u2192 isolates CDC load\n\u2022 Watcher uses pgoutput plugin (no external slot consumers) \u2014 zero-config logical replication\n\u2022 NATS subject hierarchy: cdc.{projectId}.{schema}.{table}  \u2014 allows wildcard subscriptions\n\u2022 RLS is enforced in GraphQL layer before sending to client \u2014 matches query-time behavior",
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    }
  ],
  "appState": {
    "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff",
    "gridSize": null
  },
